	"title"			"Show Faction Reputation"
	"description"		"[h1]Show Faction Reputation[/h1]\n\nShows the player's numeric reputation with each faction on the mission briefing / contract tooltip (next to the tech level).\n\n[b]What it does[/b]\n[list]\n[*] Appends reputation to the faction header on mission tooltips (e.g. TU 3 · 12)\n[*] Uses the game's own Faction.PlayerReputation value\n[*] UI-only QoL — no gameplay changes, safe to add/remove\n[/list]\n\n[b]Compatibility[/b]\n[list]\n[*] Quasimorph 1.0\n[*] Soft-compatible with mods that also patch the same tooltip (e.g. Show Tech Level) — this mod runs last and appends to the final text\n[*] No hard dependencies (Harmony is already bundled with the game)\n[/list]\n\n[b]Source[/b]\nhttps://github.com/blvcknwh1te/QM_ShowFactionReputation"
	"changenote"		"Release: latest DLL + updated preview (graphite background)."
}
